  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Where do you get your "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "inspiration",
      "ref": "v-inspiration"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "? For Levon Biss, it came to him while he was looking at some insects from his garden. He had bought a "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "microscope",
      "ref": "v-microscope"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for his son. For fun, they put an insect under the "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "lens",
      "zh": "镜头"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". “It was just so beautiful,” said Levon. He wondered if he could capture that beauty in a photograph."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Levon is from London. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " But the insects gave him a new direction. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Each of these pictures takes a few weeks to make. Levon uses a camera with a microscope lens. The camera is placed on a special rail. He takes a shot, and then moves the camera by seven "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "microns",
      "zh": "微米"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for the next shot. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " In the end, he might find himself with about 10,000 shots of an insect. A computer puts them together into a single picture."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Recently, Levon worked with scientists at the American Museum of Natural History in New York City. With their help, he took photos of some "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "endangered",
      "ref": "v-endangered"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " insects. He also photographed some specimens of "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "extinct",
      "ref": "v-extinct"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " insects. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "“Around the world, the number of insects is dropping. They are being killed by "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "pesticides",
      "zh": "杀虫剂"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " and climate change,” said Levon. “"
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "”"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "label": "",
   "instruction": "Fill in each blank in the article with a proper sentence given below. Each sentence can be used only once. Note that there are two more sentences than you will need.",
   "bank": [
    {
     "id": "A",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "He exhibited these photos at the museum."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "B",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "He turned to taking close-up photos of them."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "C",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "He had been taking photos for advertisements."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "D",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "He used a special camera that could fly around the insects."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "E",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "His son helped him choose which insects to photograph first."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "F",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "Seven microns is about one-tenth the thickness of a human hair."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "G",
     "content": [
      {
       "t": "text",
       "v": "I hope my photos can get people to care more about protecting insects."
      }
     ]
    }
